**/worktrees.jsonl.lock
**/artifacts/delivery_state.json.lock

# Figma asset cache: the artwork a screen ships, downloaded into
# artifacts/specs/_figma/<feature>/assets/. These are BINARIES and they are
# reproducible - each manifest.json carries the file key, scale and per-asset
# download block, so `download_figma_images` rebuilds the folder exactly.
# One landing page is 37 MB; committing 13 screens would push this repo past
# 500 MB, permanently, and it is pushed off-box (Decision I). The manifest is
# the contract and IS committed; the pixels are a cache.
**/artifacts/specs/_figma/*/assets/*
!**/artifacts/specs/_figma/*/assets/manifest.json
